```bash
cd /home/blee/wonderlab-studio
npm ci                                              # installs @scratch/scratch-gui 15.2.0 exactly (package-lock.json)
python3 server/studio_server.py --port 8920         # open http://127.0.0.1:8920/   (stub AI, no model calls)

