Bundle (gzip -9, what nginx `gzip_static` would send):

| File | Raw | Gzipped |
|---|---|---|
| scratch-gui-standalone.js (everything: React, GUI, VM, renderer, blocks, paint, audio, TF.js) | 17.18 MB | **5.71 MB** |
| Our code (studio*.js, css, html, opcodes.json) | 73 KB | 25 KB |
| Cold load total (26 requests) | 17.3 MB decoded | **5.77 MB transferred** |
| Warm reload (HTTP cache) | — | 30 KB |

