| Profile | Ready |
|---|---|
| localhost, no throttling | 1.5 s (first run 3.1 s) |
| school Wi-Fi model: 20 Mbit/s, 40 ms RTT | **3.8 s** |
| same + 4x CPU slowdown (low-end laptop / tablet) | **7.5 s** |
